  terrain: Massive cargo terminals, container yards, ship berths, drydocks, refineries, elevated highways, rail spurs, and fortified control towers.
  vegetation: Sparse industrial weeds and riverbank grass.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: AA guns, radar, bunkers. Industrial: warehouses, cranes, pipelines, refineries. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, boats, drones.'
  effects: Smoke, steam, water spray, sparks, and industrial haze.
  audio: Machinery, water flow, alarms, and radio chatter.
  lodBudget:
  - category: Primary Terrain
    count: 3
    trianglesPerItem: 200000
    totalTriangles: 600000
  - category: Industrial/Rural
    count: 4
    trianglesPerItem: 80000
    totalTriangles: 320000
